xtensible content handling.], EvidenceItem[file=models/spring-ai-mistral-ai/src/main/java/org/springframework/ai/mistralai/api/MistralAiApi.java, lines=1151,1203, reason=The ChatCompletionMessage class includes extractReferenceContent, extractThinkingReferenceContent, and extractThinkingTextContent methods, supporting structured output for future AI capabilities.]]]
